1. Constructor: add WeatherRepository, OccupationRepository.
2. `setWeatherMinima(WeatherMinimaSetRequest)` — validate zone exists (404), windows (422: degenerate, negative, overlap), then in tx: lock coord_lock, increment standards version, delete+insert minima, dedup.
3. `uploadForecast(ForecastUploadRequest)` — validate entries (zone exists 404, degenerate/negative/overlap per zone 422), lock, increment forecast version, insert entries.
4. `getWeatherMinima(zoneId)` — query.
5. `getForecast(version)` — query; `getCurrentForecast()`.
6. `review(ReviewRequest)` — extend with weather check.
7. `reviewBatch(ReviewBatchRequest)` — all-or-nothing.
8. `createOccupation(OccupationCreateRequest)`.
